91-### G01 — Architecture improvement workflow
92-
93-Follow [the handoff](architecture-handoff.md) and the requested
94-improve-codebase-architecture skill. Explore the named areas, show a temporary
95-HTML report with before/after candidates, ask the owner to choose, and grill the
96-selected design. Produce ADRs, interface/test ownership, dependency/import
97-decisions, and concrete chunk command specifications. Review the architecture
98-at least 9/10 in every critical dimension and overall. Revise this plan if the
99-selected design affects it, then re-review affected planning evidence.
100-
101-No application scaffolding, shared-source refactoring, real-data migration,
